local.properties

# Signing files
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
# Deliberate exception, already tracked and intentionally kept: androidTest's resolver-test.p12 is a
# self-signed throwaway for CN=127.0.0.1 whose password ("linkstest") is written in the test source
# itself. It is not a secret - nothing outside that test trusts it - so ignoring it would only make
# the instrumented test suite look like it has a missing resource. Ignore rules do not apply to files
# already tracked, so this note is the documentation rather than a mechanism.

# JVM crash dumps and JIT replay logs. The Gradle daemon is killed by memory pressure on this
# machine often enough that these accumulate in the module directory; they are not source and
# must never be committed. See SESSION_HANDOVER.md section 5.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# OS files
.DS_Store
captures/
